8365       ods trace on;
8366       data hiv;
8367       input Left Right Stage Dose CdLow CdHigh;
8368       if (Left=0) then Left=.;
8369       if (Right>=26) then Right=.;
8370       datalines;

NOTE: The data set WORK.HIV has 31 observations and 6 variables.

8402       ;
8403       proc icphreg data=hiv;
8404       class Stage Dose / desc;
8405       model (Left, Right) = Stage Dose;
8406       run;

NOTE: The option BASEHAZ of the MODEL statement was not specified. Fitting the model with a constant baseline hazard with 5 segments.

